sequenceDiagram
  actor M as Maintainer
  participant R as GitHub repo
  participant A as GitHub Actions
  participant G as GHCR
  participant P as Production
  M->>R: git tag v1.4.0 (on main) + push
  R->>A: Trigger on tag v*
  A->>R: Check commit is reachable from main
  A->>G: Find image sha-commit
  A->>A: Check DAST passed for this commit
  A->>G: Verify cosign signature + provenance
  A->>G: Retag sha-commit as 1.4.0, 1.4, 1
  A->>P: Deploy ghcr.io/org/app:1.4.0 (manual approval)
  P->>G: Pull image
  A->>R: Create GitHub Release with notes + SBOM
